<section class="note" id="lighting-note" data-chapter="The lighting note" data-surface="theme" aria-label="The lighting note"><div class="in">
    <div class="chead rise"><p class="kicker">Chapter 2 · What comes in the box</p><h2 class="big">The lighting note</h2>
      <p class="plain">Every NERO piece comes with a small printed card that tells you how to light it at home: where the lamp goes, which bulb, how far to dim it. Choose a moment below and watch what the light does to the loveseat.</p></div>
    <div class="ngrid">
      <div class="lnote">
        <div class="lphoto"><img data-img="eclisse" alt="The Eclisse loveseat in its room"><canvas id="gl3" aria-label="The Eclisse loveseat, relit live for the moment you choose"></canvas><span class="ltag" id="ltag">Early evening · 2700 K · 40%</span></div>
        <div class="seg moods" id="moods" role="group" aria-label="Choose a moment">
          <button type="button" data-m="ceiling" aria-pressed="false">Ceiling light<small>no note</small></button>
          <button type="button" data-m="evening" aria-pressed="true">Early evening<small>the note</small></button>
          <button type="button" data-m="reading" aria-pressed="false">Reading<small>brighter</small></button>
          <button type="button" data-m="late" aria-pressed="false">Late at night<small>lower</small></button>
        </div>
        <p class="cap" id="mcap">Early evening: the last blue daylight is still in the room, and the lamp lays a warm pool on the seat and the floor in front of it.</p>
      </div>
      <article class="card" aria-label="The lighting note card for the Eclisse loveseat">
        <div class="ch"><span class="wm">NERO</span><span>Lighting note</span></div>
        <h3>Eclisse loveseat</h3>
        <p class="for" id="nfor">For an early evening</p>
        <dl><dt>The lamp</dt><dd id="nlamp">The Eclisse arc lamp, standing to the left of the loveseat</dd>
          <dt>The shade</dt><dd id="nshade">Above the seat, so the bulb is hidden</dd>
          <dt>The bulb</dt><dd id="nbulb">2700 K, warm white</dd>
          <dt>The dimmer</dt><dd id="ndim">40%</dd>
          <dt>The shadow</dt><dd id="nshadow">Falls back and to the right, onto the wall</dd></dl>
        <p class="foot" id="nfoot">One card ships with every piece, with a setting for each part of the evening.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div></section>
